      "subject": "The SDK loads under plain node",
      "body": "Two exports in packages/platform-sdk had no .js extension since\ncad362c3. tsx resolves them, but node's ES module loader refuses\ndirectory and extensionless imports, so npm start (node dist/index.js)\ncould not load the SDK once it was built from source.\n\nMission: MS-2026-0009\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AHtXdN7VRusNxTFHzk5uFe",
